{"step_index":307,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T14:02:35Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-02T07:02:35-07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-02T07:02:40-07:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n=== STARTING FULL INTEGRATION TEST SUITE ===\n\n1. Testing User Registration...\n✓ Registration passed. User ID: 1\n\n2. Testing Empty State Guarantee (Zero Dummy Data)...\n✓ Clean empty state verified (0 bills, 0 expenses, 0 pantry items).\n\n3. Testing Budget Management...\n✓ Monthly budget set to $3500.00\n\n4. Testing Bills & Rent Management with Tiered Reminders...\n✓ 6 bills created across Rent, Utilities, Education, and Household Help.\n✓ Rent bill ($1400.00) successfully marked as Paid.\n✓ Monthly Bill Summary: Total Billed = $2525.49, Paid = $1400, Pending = $1125.49, Overdue = $0\n\n5. Testing Daily Expense Management...\n✓ Expense search passed (found \"Monthly Metro Transit Pass\"). Total recorded expenses: 167.9\n\n6. Testing Pantry Management & Market Purchase Flow...\n✓ Suggested shopping list generated accurately (2 items low in stock).\n✓ Market Purchase executed: Basmati Rice stock increased to 5.5 kg, and pantry expenditure of $15.00 recorded.\n\n7. Testing Real Notification & Reminder Engine...\n✓ Notification engine evaluated 4 active alerts (overdue bills, upcoming deadlines, pantry low stock).\n   - [WARNING] 4 Days Left: City Electricity Bill: City Electricity Bill ($145.50) is due in 4 days (2026-09-05).\n   - [DANGER] Due Today (17h left): Fiber Internet Bill: Fiber Internet Bill ($79.99) is due today! 17 hours remaining.\n   - [DANGER] Overdue Bill: Municipal Water Bill: Municipal Water Bill ($48.20) is overdue by 2 days (Due: 2026-08-30).\n   - [DANGER] Out of Stock: Extra Virgin Olive Oil: Extra Virgin Olive Oil has 0 bottles left (Threshold: 1 bottles). Added to Suggested Shopping List.\n\n8. Testing AI Suite (Live Context Assistant & Dynamic Pie Chart)...\n✓ AI Assistant responded with live context:\n   AI Output snippet: ### Upcoming & Unpaid Bills You have **5** unpaid bill(s) totaling **$1173.69**: - **Municipal Water Bill** (Water bill): $48.20 — Due **2026-08-30** (Overdue) - **Fiber Internet B...\n✓ AI-Generated Pie Chart rendered \"Bills by Category\" with 6 dynamic slices.\n\n9. Testing Complete Expense Summary...\n✓ Complete summary verified: Total Outflow = $1560.4 across 4 distinct categories.\n\n========================================\n✨ ALL ACCEPTANCE TESTS PASSED (100%) ✨\n========================================\n\n\n"}
{"step_index":308,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T14:02:40Z","thinking":"Thoroughly validated the complete integration test suite, confirming 100% success across all scenarios. Systematically reviewed the master prompt against all specified requirements. Every critical aspect – production readiness, absence of dummy data, a persistent database with all specified features, and real authentication with secure password hashing and token management – is fully compliant.\n\n\nConsidering the core household financial features, it's essential to define data structures for bills, expenses, pantry items, and budget parameters to create a unified system. Implementing features such as due date tracking, reminder tiers, expense categorization, and pantry stock level monitoring is critical for accurate financial management. The AI assistant should have access to this real-time household context to provide helpful conversational insights.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Complete Walkthrough and Verification Report for the Household Management Application. Details all implemented features, database architecture, real authentication, bill reminders, pantry stock with market purchasing, budget analytics, AI suite, pie chart visualizations, theme engine, and test results.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Household Management Application — Walkthrough & Verification Report\\n\\nA complete, production-ready, fully demonstrable **Household Management Application (HomeSphere)** built with genuine persistent database storage, real JWT authentication, zero dummy data, precision financial calculations, an automated 7-tier bill reminder engine, smart pantry inventory with market purchasing, budget monitoring with saving alerts, an AI intelligence suite, and responsive visualizations utilizing **strictly pie charts**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Key Features Implemented\\n\\n### 1. Real Authentication & Welcome Page\\n- **Welcome Landing Experience**: High-converting hero showcase with dynamic light/dark theme toggle and currency selector (`$`, `€`, `£`, `₹`, `C$`, `A$`, `¥`, `CHF`).\\n- **Real JWT & Password Hashing**: Passwords encrypted with `bcryptjs`, sessions authenticated via signed JWT tokens persisted across browser refreshes and restarts.\\n- **User Data Isolation**: Multi-tenant database architecture with foreign key cascading and strict query-level user isolation.\\n\\n### 2. Dashboard Overview (Zero Dummy Data)\\n- **Live Household KPIs**:\\n  - **Estimated Monthly Budget vs. Total Spent vs. Remaining Balance** (with real-time utilization progress bar).\\n  - **Unpaid & Overdue Bills Count & Total Amount**.\\n  - **Daily Expenses Total**.\\n  - **Low-Stock Pantry Items Count**.\\n- **Urgent Alert Banners**: Surfaces top critical alerts (Overdue bills, bills due today/tomorrow, budget overrun, low pantry stock).\\n- **Monthly Spending Distribution Pie Chart**: Visual breakdown of Paid Bills vs Daily Expenses vs Pantry Purchases.\\n- **Quick Action Triggers & Recent Ledger Activities**.\\n\\n### 3. Bills & Rent Management\\n- **All 13 Mandatory Categories Supported**:\\n  - `Rent`, `Water bill`, `Electricity bill`, `Gas bill`, `Internet bill`, `School fees`, `College fees`, `University fees`, `Household help fees`, `Education fees`, `Household fees`, `Online shopping payments`, `Package amounts`.\\n- **Status Lifecycle**: Dynamical\n<truncated 6655 bytes>","Description":"\"Create comprehensive Walkthrough and Verification Report\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\HP\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\eebec2ed-3589-4249-aadf-408a444636c0\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing walkthrough report\"","toolSummary":"\"Write walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
