{"step_index":314,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T14:17:16Z","content":"The **Household Management Application (HomeSphere)** is completely built, verified, and running live.\n\n### 🚀 Application Status: **Ready & Running**\n- **Live URL**: `http://localhost:5000`\n- **Source Code & Workspace**: `C:\\Users\\HP\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\household-app`\n- **Persistent Database**: `C:\\Users\\HP\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\household-app\\data\\household.db`\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Verified Feature Checklist:\n- [x] **Welcome Page & Real Authentication**: Sign up, sign in, password hashing with `bcryptjs`, JWT token persistence, multi-currency support (`$`, `€`, `£`, `₹`, etc.), and strict user-data isolation.\n- [x] **Zero Dummy Data**: Clean empty states on new accounts; all statistics, charts, and recommendations compute strictly from user data.\n- [x] **Bills & Rent Management**: All 13 mandatory categories, real payment statuses (`Paid`, `Pending`, `Overdue`), automated 7-tier reminders (**15d**, **10d**, **7d**, **4d**, **3d**, **1d**, **hours left / due today**), and Monthly Bill Summaries.\n- [x] **Expense Management**: Daily expenses (`Food`, `Transport`, `Utility`, `Other daily expenses`), instant live search, full CRUD, date filtering, and category distribution pie charts.\n- [x] **Pantry Management**: Stock tracking, low-threshold alerts, one-click `+`/`-` controls, Market Purchase flow (which increases stock and records spending), dynamic Suggested Shopping List with cost estimates, and total pantry spending metrics.\n- [x] **Budget Management**: Estimated monthly budget limit, real-time spent & remaining balance calculation, **Budget-Running-Low Alert** (80%+ threshold), and **Saving Alert** (budget exceeded).\n- [x] **AI Features Suite**:\n  - **AI Assistant**: Live conversational chatbot analyzing stored bills, expenses, pantry stock, and budget.\n  - **Smart Recommendations**: Data-backed priority action cards.\n  - **AI Summary**: Comprehensive financial and pantry executive briefings.\n  - **AI-Generated Pie Chart**: Dynamic natural language query to customized pie chart renderer.\n- [x] **Data Visualizations**: **Strictly Pie Charts Only** (overall spending breakdown, category distributions, bill type breakdowns, and month-over-month comparisons).\n- [x] **Complete Expense Summary**: Multi-period financial audit reports and print view.\n- [x] **UI/UX Design & Theming**: ☀️ Light Mode & 🌙 Dark Mode with persistent toggle, responsive layout across all device screens, and live in-app notification center drawer.\n\nYou can start using the application immediately by opening **[http://localhost:5000](http://localhost:5000)** in your web browser."}
