\n### 2. UI DOES NOT UPDATE UNTIL THE PAGE IS MANUALLY REFRESHED\r\n\r\nCurrently, when I perform an action such as:\r\n\r\n* Add a bill\r\n* Delete a bill\r\n* Add an expense\r\n* Delete an expense\r\n* Change pantry quantity\r\n* Add/remove pantry items\r\n* Update budget\r\n* Change any\n<truncated 3435 bytes>\nlication already has a currency-selection setting, add PKR to that existing system rather than creating a separate currency mechanism.\r\n* Do NOT hardcode currency values in a way that breaks the existing currency system.\r\n\r\nThis is ONLY a currency update. Do not make unrelated UI or functionality changes.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS\r\n\r\nThese are TARGETED FIXES.\r\n\r\nDo NOT:\r\n\r\n* Redesign the UI\r\n* Change the existing visual design\r\n* Remove existing features\r\n* Simplify existing functionality\r\n* Replace working components unnecessarily\r\n* Change the application's existing feature scope\r\n* Introduce unrelated features\r\n* Replace the existing architecture without a genuine technical reason\r\n* Use dummy data\r\n* Use fake APIs\r\n* Simulate email delivery\r\n* Hardcode production credentials\r\n* Hardcode API keys\r\n* Break existing authentication\r\n* Break existing database functionality\r\n* Remove existing currencies\r\n\r\nPreserve everything that is already working.\r\n\r\nBefore making changes, inspect the existing codebase and identify the actual root causes of all four problems.\r\n\r\nAfter implementing the fixes, test the complete application and verify that existing functionality still works.\r\n\r\nDo not tell me that a feature is fixed merely because the code compiles. Verify the actual end-to-end behavior.\r\n\r\n## FINAL ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA\r\n\r\n1. Real email notifications are actually delivered to the authenticated user's registered email.\r\n2. Application data updates immediately without manually refreshing the browser.\r\n3. The application is deployed through a real internet-accessible production URL and works from multiple devices.\r\n4. PKR is supported and is the default currency throughout the application.\r\n5. Existing features continue working.\r\n6. Existing supported currencies continue working.\r\n7. No dummy/fake implementations are used.\r\n8. No production secrets are exposed.\r\n9. No unrelated changes are made.\r\n\n\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-02T08:22:16-07:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>","truncated_fields":["content"]}
